<title>USA: Interwest Bancorp raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Interwest Bancorp raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>OAK HARBOR, Wash. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>InterWest Bancorp Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.14 a share from $0.13.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable January 10 to shareholders of record December 27.</p>
</text>
